{"id":"6f3c3646-e8aa-444e-bba9-2014436db608","title":"Venetian Noir 2","slug":"venetian-noir-2","collectionSlug":"venetian-noir","collectionName":"Venetian Noir","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dramatic chiaroscuro lighting effect simulating sunlight streaming through venetian blinds onto a textured plaster wall. The composition features horizontal light bands (approximately 5-6 slats) rendered in off-white (#efe9dd) separated by deep shadow gaps in black (#000000). The wall surface itself transitions from dark charcoal (#2a2928) in the upper left to near-black (#141416) toward the lower right, creating a subtle diagonal gradient that suggests volumetric depth. The light bands are rendered with soft, diffused edges (softness: 0.15) creating a penumbral effect that mimics the natural shadow gradation of venetian blinds. A spherical light bounce effect (radius 0.75, opacity 0.09) in linear dodge blend mode adds a subtle warm glow at approximately 36% horizontal and 45% vertical position, suggesting ambient light reflection. The entire composition is processed through perspective distortion (FOV 90°, pan 30°, tilt 18°, zoom 2.3) creating a tilted, three-dimensional appearance as if viewing the wall at an oblique angle. A progressive blur effect with 60 intensity and 0.7 falloff centered at the upper left (22%, 20%) creates a soft penumbral shadow that gradually transitions from sharp to blurred, enhancing the photorealistic quality. The overall mood is moody, architectural, and evocative of interior lighting studies with strong contrast between illuminated and shadowed areas.","colors":["#efe9dd","#000000","#2a2928","#141416"],"labels":["geometric","dark","dramatic","3d"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/6f3c3646-e8aa-444e-bba9-2014436db608.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"LinearGradient","id":"idmw57y4iqylw01p7tu","_key":"key_idmw57y4iqylw01p7tu","props":{"end":{"x":0.05,"y":1},"angle":0,"edges":"stretch","start":{"x":0.8,"y":0.2},